OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening to come. A clear and dry night
OL,7,Ffor all. Feeling rather cool or even
OL,8,Fchilly in rural spots with some mist
OL,9,Fpatches in the Valleys.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA dry and bright morning.
OL,12,FHigh cloud at times will turn the
OL,13,Fsunshine hazy. Feeling pleasantly warm
OL,14,Fto even hot in the sunshine.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FHigh
OL,17,Fpressure remains in charge for the
OL,18,Fnext few days. Although temperatures
OL,19,Fmay dip slightly on Monday, they will
OL,20,Fstart to climb again on Tuesday.
OL,21,FStaying mostly dry throughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
